# Who to ask about each part of the estate.
#
# This is the demo estate's copy, not this repository's. A forge reads
# CODEOWNERS from the root, from .github/ and from docs/, and reads nowhere
# else - so a file here states ownership for the estate portolan describes
# without asking GitHub to request a review from a team that does not exist.
# A real repository puts it in one of those three places and points the
# manifest's `in` at the directory it is in.
#
# The patterns are repository-relative, matched against each service's path as
# the catalog holds it. Later rules win, so the catch-all comes first.

*                               @shortlink-org/platform

examples/auth                   @shortlink-org/identity
examples/shop                   @shortlink-org/shop
examples/shop/oms               @shortlink-org/shop-oms  @shortlink-org/platform
examples/shop/delivery          @shortlink-org/delivery
